            "url": "{{base_url}}/api/orders/{{order_id}}/cancel",
            "description": "Placed -> cancelled; repeated requests return stable timestamps with no further inventory restoration. Promotion usage stays consumed. Missing/foreign ID: 404; invalid state/restoration overflow: 409. Expected success: 200."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Expected HTTP status [200]', () => pm.expect([200]).to.include(pm.response.code));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "response": []
        }
      ],
      "description": "Checkout and cancellation: 20/minute/user in separate categories. History/details: 120/minute/user. A throttled checkout has no purchase, inventory, promotion, cart or outbox effects. Preserve the original Idempotency-Key on retries; replays are subject to the same checkout quota."
    },
